# Handle Missing Right-Side Image

## Goal
Skip members who do not have a right-side image (current photo) and print their name.

## Proposed Changes

### [New Folder]

#### [MODIFY] [browser_handler.py](file:///d:/New%20folder/browser_handler.py)
1.  **[click_member_view](file:///d:/New%20folder/browser_handler.py#72-84)**: 
    - Extract the text of the member row (identifying the member name).
    - Return [(True, member_name)](file:///d:/New%20folder/main.py#4-92) instead of just `True`.
2.  **[download_right_image](file:///d:/New%20folder/browser_handler.py#85-117)**:
    - Stricter check: If fewer than 2 download buttons are found, assume the Right side image is missing.
    - Return `None` (or raise a specific exception) instead of falling back to the single button.

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///d:/New%20folder/main.py)
1.  Update the loop to unpack `success, member_name = browser.click_member_view(i)`.
2.  Log the `member_name` during processing.
3.  If [download_right_image](file:///d:/New%20folder/browser_handler.py#85-117) fails (returns `None`), explicitly log: `"Skipping {member_name} - No image at the right side."`.

